// Draft text. Review it before the site goes live, for example with a privacy policy generator.
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy">
  <div class="container page-content">
    <section class="legal">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>

      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>The person named in the <a href="/impressum/">Impressum</a> is responsible for this website.</p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted on GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc. When you open a page, GitHub processes technical
        data such as your IP address to deliver the page and keep the service secure.
      </p>

      <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
      <p>This site sets no cookies and uses no analytics. Its fonts are served from this site, not from Google Fonts.</p>

      <h2>Embedded videos and games</h2>
      <p>
        Videos from YouTube and games from itch.io load only after you click on them. From that moment, YouTube (Google)
        or itch.io receive your IP address and may set cookies under their own privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR you can ask for access to, correction or deletion of your personal data, restrict or object to its
        processing, and complain to a data protection authority.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
